    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you just break up? Struggling with your studies? Is your boss a total jerk?<br>Forget it all and come smash a washing machine\u2014you\u2019ll feel so much better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique game, you destroy various objects in a space arena against the clock.<br>Choose one of four different characters and show that damn washing machine who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushiator is a game developed solo by a designer with a rather... unusual mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique characters</strong>: Each with distinct animations and smashing styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 breakable objects</strong>: Washing machines, wooden crates, cars, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player mode</strong>: Try to beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer (split-screen)</strong>: Face off against a friend! The first to break the object or deal the most damage wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Musics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu music by qubesounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena music by Music by evgenybardyuzha </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you just break up? Struggling with your studies? Is your boss a total jerk?<br>Forget it all and come smash a washing machine\u2014you\u2019ll feel so much better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique game, you destroy various objects in a space arena against the clock.<br>Choose one of four different characters and show that damn washing machine who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crushiator is a game developed solo by a designer with a rather... unusual mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique characters</strong>: Each with distinct animations and smashing styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 breakable objects</strong>: Washing machines, wooden crates, cars, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player mode</strong>: Try to beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local multiplayer (split-screen)</strong>: Face off against a friend! The first to break the object or deal the most damage wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Musics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu music by qubesounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena music by Music by evgenybardyuzha </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
